          "systemPromptTemplate": "Extract the lead information.\n \nFor the following fields, use ONLY the allowed values.\n \nneed_status:\n- specific\n- general\n- none\n \nbudget_status:\n- approved_reserved\n- available_not_fixed\n- unknown\n- unavailable\n \ntimeline_status:\n- within_1_month\n- few_months\n- within_12_months\n- next_year_or_vague\n- none\n \nscope_status:\n- large_multi_country_or_100plus\n- medium_or_multi_team\n- small_company_under_10\n \nengagement_status:\n- proposal_requested\n- concrete_follow_up\n- materials_or_info_requested\n- casual_interest\n- none\n \nNever create alternative values.\nAlways return one of the values above exactly as written."
        }
